---
// WhyCleanCard.astro - Linear / Vercel Threat Breakdown
---

<section class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-4">
  <!-- Interactive Terminal Comparison: Raw vs Scrubbed -->
  <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800/80 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 text-left">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-neutral-800">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-400"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white tracking-tight">Memory Buffer Payload Inspection</h3>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-400 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
        Zero Cloud APIs
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
      <!-- Raw Untouched Photo -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 p-3.5 border border-neutral-800">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-400 pb-2 mb-2 border-b border-neutral-900 text-[11px]">
          <span class="font-medium text-rose-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
            Raw Image Telemetry
          </span>
          <span class="text-[9px] bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-400">52 Headers</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] space-y-1">
[GPS] Latitude: 37° 46' 29.80" N
[GPS] Longitude: 122° 25' 09.84" W
[GPS] Altitude: 15.2 meters
[Device] Make: Apple
[Device] Model: iPhone 15 Pro Max
[Device] Serial: DN6L4980P0K5
[Lens] Model: 6.86mm f/1.78
[Time] Timestamp: 2026:10:14 15:32:18
[XMP] Embedded Document IDs</pre>
      </div>

      <!-- After CleanPhoto Scrub -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 p-3.5 border border-neutral-800">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-400 pb-2 mb-2 border-b border-neutral-900 text-[11px]">
          <span class="font-medium text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            CleanPhoto Sanitized
          </span>
          <span class="text-[9px] bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-400">0 Headers</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] space-y-1">
[GPS] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[GPS] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[GPS] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Device] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Device] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Device] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Lens] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Time] &lt;STRIPPED IN RAM&gt;
[Payload] Pure RGBA Pixels Only</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
